[Options]

[A.]
<h2>~[Iisland.*]~kAttack ~won ~kDeath~tStar</h2><br>
<i>"You like the others shall die"<br>
--Death Star</i>  
<p>Now you face the almighty ~kDeath~tStar.
<p>~.You and your two allys must kill ~kDeath~tStar

$Button=stuff,ShowTechnology,55
$Button=Kill him!,DoNothing,0

[ai2PriestDead]
<h2>Guard one is dead!</h2><br>
<p>Now kill ~kDeath~tStar

[ai3PriestDead]
<h2>Guard two is Dead!</h2><br>
<p>Now kill ~kDeath~tStar

[@800]
<h2>Keep Fighting!</h2>
<p> You can do it!

[@1800]
<h2>Don't Give Up Now!</h2>
<p>Don't give up, keep fighting to the very end!

[ai4TempleHalfDead]
<h2>~kDeath~tStar ~.has almost Perished!</h2>
<p>Keep fighting my friend!

[Succeeded][ai4PriestDead]
<h2>Sucsess</h2><br>
<p>~kDeath~tStar ~.has been given to the furies now peace has come to Nimbus! Now you've got to escape!

<$Config,Done{mission.fileName}=1>
$Button=Leave Missions,MissionAbort,0
$Button=Next Mission,MissionBegin,escape

[Failed]
<h2>Failure!</h2>
<p>
The ~kDeath~tStar ~.has killed you! Not Suprised!
Let him take over Nimbus or give it another shot!

$Button=Continue,Tell,TryAgain

[END]
